   Copyright (c) 2016-2019 Drew DeVault
   Ported logic: the two-process auth architecture and pipe wire protocol
   (comm.c), the PAM conversation flow including the one-shot prompt guard
   (pam.c), the mlock'd password-buffer scheme and its clear points
   (password-buffer.c, password.c), the keysym handling table and indicator
